          "text": "If you aren't yet bold enough to install the Codex app, you can stay in the presence of your orange crab and point it at GPT 5.6 Sol. Takes 5 minutes. Kudos to Theo for explaining one of the ways to get this done.\n\nStep 1: Install CLIProxyAPI\nStep 2: Connect\nStep 3: Define following alias and enjoy claudex\n\n```\nalias claudex='CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=gpt-5.6-sol \\\nCLAUDE_CODE_ALWAYS_ENABLE_EFFORT=1 \\\nCLAUDE_CODE_MAX_TOOL_USE_CONCURRENCY=3 \\\nENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH=false \\\nclaude --model gpt-5.6-sol'\n```\n\nIf this gets blocked, I owe you a reset."
        },
